  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are an unstoppable juggernaut of death and destruction.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Raging Deathblow<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain an additional number of rounds of rage per day from Raging Deathblow equal to 1/2 your mythic tier (minimum 1). Whenever you rest to renew your total number of rounds of rage per day, any extra rounds you still have from this feat are lost.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-rage-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
